5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry that the seating plan will quietly decide who talks to whom, without us choosing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The current layout hides who gets the worse spots. We need to address that imbalance directly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m a bit nervous about changing things. I just want to make sure we aren’t wasting money on a layout that doesn’t work.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about losing my tiny gaps between meetings. I need to know exactly how much time the switch and daily setup will eat up.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Comfort is invisible on paper. I need to check the physical setup.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I understand your worry about time. Let us see if the new plan actually saves us those precious moments.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, cost is secondary to fairness. We must ensure the allocation of undesirable seats is explicit, not accidental.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I hear you, but I really need to see the actual numbers first. I’m worried we’re spending too much.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, I agree fairness matters, but I need to know if the daily routine actually works for my schedule.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, time is just another form of discomfort. I’ll ensure the physical setup doesn’t add to your daily friction.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, that is very kind. I am curious about the sound levels, too. A quiet corner helps me think clearly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, sound is a measurable form of inequality. I will verify the readings to ensure the quiet zones are distributed fairly, not by luck.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shizue, I appreciate that. I’m just trying to understand if the current billing covers what we actually use.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, I hope the billing is fair, but I’m more worried about the daily time cost. Can we check the morning routine?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, I will check the sound meter readings. If the noise is bad, your gaps are useless.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the drawn plan against the staff survey and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
