35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The plan ignores the daylight complaint, and the new joiners learned by eavesdropping. I worry the layout dictates our connections.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The billing is area-based, not headcount. We pay for empty desks. The shuffles caused two weeks of chaos each time.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, that is worrying. We are paying for empty space, and moving desks costs six thousand yen each time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, nine minutes daily is brutal for my gaps. And two weeks of chaos? I need a layout that stays put.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Nine decibels louder by the printer. And my chair takes days to settle. I need a spot that stays put and stays quiet.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, I hear you. A stable, quiet spot is vital. Let us ensure the new plan respects your need for peace and proper adjustment.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, stability is key. The shuffles prove that ad-hoc changes are costly. We need a fixed structure to prevent that chaos.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. If every move costs six thousand yen, we really need to get the layout right the first time.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, exactly. If we fix the spots, I keep my gaps. I hate the idea of two weeks of half-packed boxes again.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, I agree. Stability is non-negotiable. I need a fixed spot to let my chair settle properly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I agree. Stability helps everyone. But I wonder if fixed desks might isolate us. How do we keep the team connected?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, isolation is a risk, but we can mitigate it by grouping desks by function. Stability prevents the chaos we just saw.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shizue, I worry about that too. But if we group by function, maybe we can keep talking without moving desks.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, I agree. If we group by function, I can keep my gaps and still chat with you. Stability is my top priority!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shizue, Isolation is a myth if the acoustics are right. I need the quiet, not the chaos.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, I understand your need for quiet. Perhaps we can place you near the window, away from the printer, to ensure your peace.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, I agree. Placing the quietest spots deliberately ensures the burden is shared, not left to chance.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. If we fix the spots, we avoid those expensive re-runs. I just want to be sure the cost is manageable.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, I hope so! If the cost is manageable, I am all for fixing the spots. I really need those morning gaps back!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shizue, The window side is nine decibels quieter. That is the only spot where my chair can finally settle.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
