60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry that free seating will leave us drifting apart. I would rather we chose our neighbors deliberately, so our connections are built, not accidental.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option B. Fixed desks by function. It eliminates the chaos of shuffles and allows us to assign the worse spots deliberately, not by accident.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. Option B avoids the six thousand yen re-run costs. I just want to be sure the billing is fair for the space we actually use.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, Option B is perfect! Fixed spots mean no more morning scramble. I can finally protect my tiny gaps between meetings.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B. Fixed desks. I need a permanent spot to let my chair settle and to stay away from the printer noise.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, I agree. Option B lets us choose our neighbors on purpose. I hope we can still share a laugh over coffee, though.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, I agree. Deliberate placement ensures the burden is shared fairly. We must not let habit decide who suffers the noise.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shizue, I agree. If we fix the spots, we avoid those expensive re-runs. I just want to be sure the cost is manageable.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, I agree! Fixed spots mean I can actually plan my day. I hope we can still chat easily, though!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shizue, I can share a laugh from the window side. The printer row is for those who enjoy nine extra decibels of background noise.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I am glad you are happy. I just hope the fixed spots do not make us feel like strangers. We must keep talking.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, I agree. We can maintain connection through the functional grouping. The key is that the assignment is explicit, not accidental.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shizue, I agree. If we group by function, we can still talk without moving desks. I just want to be sure the cost is manageable.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, I agree! If we group by function, I can keep my gaps and still chat with you. Stability is my top priority!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shizue, I will talk to you. I just need the silence to let my back stop screaming. Comfort is not a luxury, it is a requirement.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
